["directions", ["use as directed by your health care professional.", "as a dietary supplement, take three (3) tablets with breakfast or, for optimal results, take one (1) tablet with each meal. dosage may be increased as directed by a healthcare practitioner.", "open tub, fill scoop to line, add scoop to 16oz of water (closed cup or shaker recommended), shake, drink, and enjoy. recommended dose is 1 serving daily and up to 3 servings max per day. use responsibly.", "follow usage directions on label.", "take one tablet daily, preferably with a meal. do not exceed stated dose.", "take one capsule twice daily 30 minutes before meals with an 8oz glass of water.", "suggested use: two soft gels daily, with food, or as directed by your health care professional or pharmacist.", "consume one or more capsules daily or as recommended by your physician. as with any dietary supplement, this product is most effective as part of a healthy diet and active lifestyle.", "1. select an area of skin. the patch will stick better if you choose an area of skin without hair, lotion, or oil residue. clean and dry the skin. 2. remove the release liner from the patch. 3. adhere the patch to your skin, pressing firmly. 4. wear the patch for as long as you would like, preferably at least 8 hours. 5. when finished, remove the patch, fold in half, and discard. 6. repeat with a new patch the next day.", "2 capsules daily preferably with meals or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "take 2 capsules daily", "please see manufacturer\u2019s label", "as a dietary supplement, mix 1 scoop of bcaa5000 with 8-10 oz of cold water before, during, or after your workout (vary amount of water by taste preference).", "adults: take two soft gels once daily at mealtime.", "drink one full bottle. best consumed while drinking, in between drinks, or right after your last drink. store at room temperature or in the fridge. do not freeze. avoid prolonged heat and sun exposure."]]
